   "authorThumbnail": [],
   "textDisplay": "It’s obviously a fake company that participates in white label tactics. Years ago, I conducted a Boxycharm investigation when I suspected Boxy was inflating box “values” by stuffing them with obscure “luxury” brands. Bottom line is that certain products felt cheaply made, and I discovered fake companies, bogus sources for their claims and testimonials, and addresses that at best, belonged to legit businesses such as Home Depot and Ross Stores, and at worst, were completely false and led to nowhere. I’m not on Tik Tok and know nothing about this specific brand, but with the prevalence of AI and paid-for influencers, I don’t trust anything I can’t find in a brick and mortar store.",
